<title>GERMANY: Germany sees over four mln jobless in next months.</title>
<headline>Germany sees over four mln jobless in next months.</headline>
<dateline>NUREMBERG, Germany 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of the German Labour Office said on Thursday that the number of people out of work could remain at record levels for months to come.</p>
<p>&quot;We could see over four million unemployed for the next few months,&quot; Bernhard Jagoda told a news conference in Nuremberg.</p>
<p>Jagoda was speaking after the government released unemployment data for November that showed jobless totals rose 50,000 to a record 4.1 million on a seasonally adjusted basis.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49 228 26097150</p>
</text>
